409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 329 0 R
/T (Because students are enrolled at both their home high school and the STEAM Center, the model depends on a deliberate partnership between the two settings. Home schools remain responsible for core academic coursework, graduation requirements, special education and related services, attendance of record, and overall enrollment. The STEAM Center is responsible for pathway instruction and progress toward certifications. A designated point of contact at each home school partners with the STEAM Center's family and partnership coordinators to resolve scheduling conflicts, exchange student updates, and co-plan supports so that no student falls between the two settings.)
/E (Because students are enrolled at both their home high school and the STEAM Center, the model depends on a deliberate partnership between the two settings. Home schools remain responsible for core academic coursework, graduation requirements, special education and related services, attendance of record, and overall enrollment. The STEAM Center is responsible for pathway instruction and progress toward certifications. A designated point of contact at each home school partners with the STEAM Center's family and partnership coordinators to resolve scheduling conflicts, exchange student updates, and co-plan supports so that no student falls between the two settings.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
