/P 329 0 R
/T (The STEAM Center model is a cross-school, industry-connected learning center. It integrates with, rather than replaces, a student's traditional high school experience: students keep their core academics at their home high school and spend part of every school day in a shared, industry-embedded center built around career pathways.)
/E (The STEAM Center model is a cross-school, industry-connected learning center. It integrates with, rather than replaces, a student's traditional high school experience: students keep their core academics at their home high school and spend part of every school day in a shared, industry-embedded center built around career pathways.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
