/T (Career pathways anchor curriculum and instruction to authentic fields such as healthcare, technology, engineering, or creative industries. The specific pathways vary by school and region, but the model always aligns projects, skill development, credentials, and work-based learning within each pathway.)
/E (Career pathways anchor curriculum and instruction to authentic fields such as healthcare, technology, engineering, or creative industries. The specific pathways vary by school and region, but the model always aligns projects, skill development, credentials, and work-based learning within each pathway.)
/Pg 14 0 R
