/Title (The STEAM Center model is a cross-school, industry-connected learning center. It integrates with, rather than replaces, a student's traditional high school experience: students keep their core academics at their home high school and spend part of every school day in a shared, industry-embedded center built around career pathways.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2018 0 R
/Next 2133 0 R
>>
endobj
