/Count -1
>>
endobj
2119 0 obj
<<
/Title (Students from multiple schools come together at a center situated within an industry-connected site. By co-locating within or directly connected to an industry context, such as a hospital, airport, manufacturing facility, or cultural institution, students experience professional environments as a consistent part of their education. Within the center, they learn in specialized spaces equipped with industry-grade tools, collaborate in environments designed to mirror professional settings, and interact with industry professionals as a routine part of the school day. The center provides resources, environments, and experiences that individual schools could not offer alone, while students stay connected to their home schools for the rest of their education.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2021 0 R
>>
endobj
