/Title (Specialized pathway spaces, designed with industry input. Partners helped define specifications, review architectural plans, and select equipment so each environment mirrors its real-world counterpart. Brooklyn's spaces include a full sound stage with control room, editing booth, and screening room; a fabrication lab; a construction workshop; and a professional-grade kitchen.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
